 {:db/id "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415" :answer-field/id #uuid "e4194eca-59dd-5baf-88db-f9e5ba650594" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/3224ab5f6f5fb64621a714f7654c4df06661a69e7edb8f5993dcef1e46ce3dea" "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/d88b66bf7c85f475bfbc39dfc91ff1d11a47a93444dd485510fa1d9fd621ee9c" "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/d94c457d7b18de019e437a77e90936a0241bfefd651805eec3f1e89b52ec2cd7" "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/718ff1f1e9146b5d5d2cf798138ec0393245e544620d23b1f48534b92efd546a" "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/f4461a75cfcc63867a66124215430d37263b92513377ba90b7359ab6fd5331c8"] :answer-field/correct "q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415/3224ab5f6f5fb64621a714f7654c4df06661a69e7edb8f5993dcef1e46ce3dea" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id "q-111520" :question/id #uuid "115b4097-0743-5174-99b1-3e6b934dfaf1" :question/math-academy-id "q-111520" :question/problem "The random variable $X$ has the following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $5$ | $10$ | $15$ | $20$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\nLet $Y=2-\\frac{X}{5}.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $2$ | $a$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $b$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $c$ | $d$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $a+b+c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's add a $Y=2-\\frac{X}{5}$ row to our table.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $5$ | $10$ | $15$ | $20$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $2$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $-2$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, ${f}_{X}(x)={f}_{Y}(y)$ for corresponding values of $X$ and $Y.$ Therefore, the distribution of $Y$ is as follows:\n\n| $y$ | $2$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $-2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\nSo, we have $a=1,b=-2,c=\\frac{1}{4},$ and therefore $a+b+c=-\\frac{3}{4}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-111520/ma-source-field/b8d3aab2e22fc949ea8fd1ab9730a1907e43779f406bfe6526e80175747b3415"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
