 {:db/id "q-117212" :question/id #uuid "0090932a-f451-563b-921a-c105fc8ef9ed" :question/math-academy-id "q-117212" :question/problem "Which of the following values is **not** in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/d2/d2677563c82c37fd1672a806a18524c97ea5ec17cb4f8ef6d8df23b827ba5e81.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The domain of the function is $[-1,1].$\n\nTherefore, the value $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ is not in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-117212/ma-source-field/6b4c5e5d7ba3154f8b45e85b07604e4bed181d754fbcf5cfeee6d5375e406635"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
