 {:db/id "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d7d8f65-a93b-5daa-b8fa-34a0b4f4a5ba" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/4af9e753006c21c2d14e93a270d27ae907496bc7f51d967c50fdb35b5ead3aa8" "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/7c60f3b3780b304d71d9fe80faecb3c11a90e99f83c54d400650dfee40c61c34" "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/b60f9fbb79fe16ddaa756f6164a78ba5a068817c4341b0904850daf993954539" "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/6b5237a365ad617c078fc4a8a1e0352898cc351c14ad6cb479f29591b39d08cd" "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/10aa8de7a21d1b49fe76a72df1ff0a44b76e42dd3395fa9f4827723c1e5ea9de"] :answer-field/correct "q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515/6b5237a365ad617c078fc4a8a1e0352898cc351c14ad6cb479f29591b39d08cd" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id "q-119039" :question/id #uuid "9f503fbb-9abb-5178-8aa2-5b5187c150ec" :question/math-academy-id "q-119039" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=20{x}^{3}.$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =20\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =20\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{x}^{4}+C \\\\  & =5{x}^{4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (5{x}^{4}+C)\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}{x}^{5}+Cx+D \\\\  & ={x}^{5}+Cx+D.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-119039/ma-source-field/34b30c9aa17c407c316a8f36144f5a2e07d9ad2e7548ec1a13ec9aac4324a515"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
